1
00:00:00,833 --> 00:00:04,416
As the Theoros, I have observed...

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,791
The Destruction's synthesis is formed!

3
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,000
I will wait for that day.

4
00:00:29,166 --> 00:00:30,208
For as long as it takes.

5
00:00:30,583 --> 00:00:31,041
The day will come...

6
00:00:31,041 --> 00:00:33,125
When someone turns over this nearly eternal page...

7
00:00:33,125 --> 00:00:34,291
And follows in our footprints...

8
00:00:34,291 --> 00:00:36,875
To write an ending unlike any that ever was.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,583
That will be a romantic story like none that has come before...

10
00:00:56,583 --> 00:00:59,625
You think so too... right?

